{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/969618-character-concept-obrimos-integrator","id":969618,"title":"Character concept: Obrimos Integrator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-14T20:19:15-07:00","id":969618,"title":"Character concept: Obrimos Integrator","content":"I was wondering if a crossover character concept I had was viable. So, she's an Obrimos, and she's investigating stuff and mysteries, and inevitably she finds out about the God-Machine (assuming it exists in her world and vice versa). She studies it and finds that it's close to her personal vision of the Supernal, but clearly flawed. So she takes an Integrator perspective- the Machine could be great, it just needs to be repaired or altered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T05:10:11-07:00","id":969827,"title":"","content":"It's an interesting idea. I haven't done a lot of thinking about Mage + God-Machine yet; most of my Mage STing was pre-GMC and I haven't really had time to kind of ruminate on the cosmology, but it definitely feels like exactly the sort of reaction a certain kind of mage would have to the G-M's existence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12136-jacobkosh","name":"jacobkosh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T07:16:47-07:00","id":969879,"title":"","content":"Assuming the character isn't a Seer, I'm not sure how the GM would align with someone's view of the Supernal. Beyond some physical resemblance to the Aether, the GM is basically a robot exarch able to summon armies of ochemata at will (or as close to). I can easily reconcile the GM being a mages obsession, but not an ideal to obtain or emulate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T07:21:22-07:00","id":969881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/969618-character-concept-obrimos-integrator?p=969879#post969879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Assuming the character isn't a Seer, I'm not sure how the GM would align with someone's view of the Supernal. Beyond some physical resemblance to the Aether, the GM is basically a robot exarch able to summon armies of ochemata at will (or as close to). I can easily reconcile the GM being a mages obsession, but not an ideal to obtain or emulate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I mean, it just depends on how much fixing the mage thinks it needs. If they're happy with it as it is, that would be pretty Seer-y, but if they look at it and see a tool that could be reconfigured to fight the Exarchs - or just another in a long line of cosmic principles that was broken and ruined by the Fall and in need of repair - that would be something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12136-jacobkosh","name":"jacobkosh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T10:01:55-07:00","id":970006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jacobkosh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/969618-character-concept-obrimos-integrator?p=969881#post969881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, I mean, it just depends on how much fixing the mage thinks it needs. If they're happy with it as it is, that would be pretty Seer-y, but if they look at it and see a tool that could be reconfigured to fight the Exarchs - or just another in a long line of cosmic principles that was broken and ruined by the Fall and in need of repair - that would be something else.</div> </div> </div> </div>The second one is sort of what I'm going for. Her Awakening had lots of visions of divine machinery and crystal spheres, and she has a theory that the Machine is somehow a reflection of that and that &quot;fixing&quot; it will majorly help fix the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}